---
import Base from '@/layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="Appearances" description="Podcasts and other appearances" ogImage="/images/og/og-appearances.png">
  <section class="simple-directory">
    <p class="simple-directory__intro">
      Podcasts, interviews, and a few places where my work has shown up outside the site itself.
    </p>

    <div class="simple-directory__group">
      <h2 class="simple-directory__heading">AI and the environment</h2>
      <ul class="simple-directory__list">
        <li class="simple-directory__item"><a href="https://open.spotify.com/episode/2E3Yfi24OUyHxz67BtzhHB?si=8110a29fe7034cf5" class="simple-directory__link">Conspicuous Cognition</a></li>
        <li class="simple-directory__item"><a href="https://open.spotify.com/episode/1Lzt9pMcqOcjfE3WLxNy3j?si=fdb4604af43d40e9" class="simple-directory__link">Chain of Thought</a></li>
        <li class="simple-directory__item"><a href="https://open.spotify.com/episode/0UaOQ0DcP9c8OG5IfAgfnT?si=5d00e4bce6aa43f0" class="simple-directory__link">NYT Hard Fork</a></li>
        <li class="simple-directory__item"><a href="https://open.spotify.com/episode/0RBBVeGb5yfHsFWnKkDgD0?si=15d8b610374544b0" class="simple-directory__link">The Cognitive Revolution</a></li>
        <li class="simple-directory__item simple-directory__item--stacked">
          <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_Ird91qfPZs" class="simple-directory__link">Good Morning America</a>
          <p class="simple-directory__note">I show up for about 5 seconds in this segment to say data centers run and store what we do online.</p>
        </li>
        <li class="simple-directory__item"><a href="https://www.azfamily.com/2026/02/26/data-centers-arent-water-villains-you-think-they-are-environmentalist-says/" class="simple-directory__link">Arizona's Family</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="simple-directory__group">
      <h2 class="simple-directory__heading">Effective altruism</h2>
      <ul class="simple-directory__list">
        <li class="simple-directory__item"><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qzNZfa2jSE8" class="simple-directory__link">Expected Volume</a></li>
        <li class="simple-directory__item"><a href="https://benthams.substack.com/p/chatting-with-andy-masley-about-ea" class="simple-directory__link">Bentham's Bulldog</a></li>
        <li class="simple-directory__item"><a href="https://www.machineculture.io/p/model-convo-andy-masley" class="simple-directory__link">Model Convos</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
